Protocol reference
------------------
This plugin's knowledge of the DeepAI Code upstream endpoints, headers, error
semantics, credential location and machine-fingerprint rules was derived from
DeepAICode2API (https://github.com/2951461586/DeepAICode2API), which is licensed
under the MIT License. No source code from that project is copied into this
repository; the facts were re-checked against the project's source and
documentation and are recorded (with evidence levels) in PROTOCOL.md.

magpie plugin specification
---------------------------
The plugin follows the magpie plugin documentation
(https://usemagpie.ai/docs/zh/plugins). The plugin is an OpenCode v1 style
provider plugin.

